                <div className="flex-1 p-5 bg-gray-950 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
                     <p className="text-[9px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed italic">Loom selectors are fixed in the left column. Horizontal scroll reveals technical selvedge and design address space.</p>
